    "_comment": "MiniCPM-V-4.7-35B-A3B. Language: qwen3.5_a3b.json (same layout as Qwen3.6-35B-A3B, llama.cpp general.architecture=qwen35moe). Vision: minicpm_v_1b.json (mmproj-model-f16.gguf, general.architecture=clip, converted with -t vision); the projector output is 2048 here.",
    "q4nx_config": {
        "row_block_size": 32,
        "col_block_size": 256,
        "parallel_size": 32,
        "keep_block_in_2D": true
    },
    "_vision_config_comment": [
        "The vision tower runs on Qwen3.8-27B's FLM_Xclbin/Qwen3_8/vision_mm, which",
        "streams w out of DDR as plain row-major (N, K) bf16, so the converter only",
        "zero-pads -- no (mm_n mm_k) re-order.  vision_MM_K is the k tile, 384 in",
        "both designs; vision_MM_N is design A's array N tile, 384.  The projector's",
        "mm.down (q4nx merger.linear_fc2, N=1024) is the one layer on design B,",
        "whose array N is 1024, hence the override; it is keyed by q4nx layer name",
        "as in qwen3.8_27b.json.  Resulting pads: mlp.linear_fc1 N 4304->4608,",
        "mlp.linear_fc2 K 4304->4608, vit_merger.mlp.linear_fc1 N 17216->17280,",
        "vit_merger.mlp.linear_fc2 K 17216->17280; attn.qkv N=3456=9*384 as is.",
        "Kept in step with FLM_Xclbin/Qwen3_8/vision_mm/iron/mm_config.py."
    ],
    "vision_config": {
        "vision_MM_K": 384,
        "vision_MM_N": 384,
        "vision_MM_N_override": {
            "merger.linear_fc2": 1024
        }
    },
